        <div></div><devsite-code><pre class="api-signature no-pretty-print" translate="no" dir="ltr" is-upgraded>suspend&nbsp;fun&nbsp;<a href="/android/reference/kotlin/com/google/mlkit/genai/prompt/GenerativeModel#clearImplicitCaches()">clearImplicitCaches</a>():&nbsp;<a href="https://kotlinlang.org/api/latest/jvm/stdlib/kotlin/-unit/index.html">Unit</a></pre></devsite-code>
        <p>Clears all caches created by implicit prefix caching.</p>
        <p>This experimental method clears all caches created by implicit prefix caching. When <code translate="no" dir="ltr">promptPrefix</code> is provided in <code translate="no" dir="ltr"><a href="/android/reference/kotlin/com/google/mlkit/genai/prompt/GenerativeModel#generateContent(com.google.mlkit.genai.prompt.GenerateContentRequest)">generateContent</a></code> or <code translate="no" dir="ltr"><a href="/android/reference/kotlin/com/google/mlkit/genai/prompt/GenerativeModel#generateContentStream(com.google.mlkit.genai.prompt.GenerateContentRequest)">generateContentStream</a></code>, the system caches its processing implicitly to reduce inference time for subsequent requests sharing the same prefix. This method clears all such created caches.</p>
      </div>
