      <div class="api-item"><a name="warmup--"></a><a name="warmup"></a>
        <div class="api-name-block">
          <div>
            <h3 id="warmup()" data-text="warmup" tabindex="-1">warmup</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div></div><devsite-code><pre class="api-signature no-pretty-print" translate="no" dir="ltr" is-upgraded>suspend&nbsp;fun&nbsp;<a href="/android/reference/kotlin/com/google/mlkit/genai/prompt/GenerativeModel#warmup()">warmup</a>():&nbsp;<a href="https://kotlinlang.org/api/latest/jvm/stdlib/kotlin/-unit/index.html">Unit</a></pre></devsite-code>
        <p>Warms up the inference engine for use by loading necessary models and initializing runtime components.</p>
        <p>While calling this method is optional, we recommend invoking it well before the first inference call to reduce the latency of the initial inference.</p>
        <div class="devsite-table-wrapper">
          <table class="responsive">
            <colgroup>
              <col width="40%">
